{"id": "g7-036", "domain": "pond", "names": ["Fish", "Frog", "Lily", "Duck"], "groups": {}, "text": "Pond scene. Turn Fish into a teal ellipse, Frog into a lime circle and Duck into a yellow circle. Group Frog and Duck as Pets, send Pets to the back. Is Lily in any group?", "wires": [{"span": "Turn Fish into a teal ellipse", "trigger": "Turn", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fish", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "teal"}}, {"span": "Frog into a lime circle", "trigger": "into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Frog", "shape": "circle", "color": "lime"}}, {"span": "Duck into a yellow circle", "trigger": "into", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Duck", "shape": "circle", "color": "yellow"}}, {"span": "Group Frog and Duck as Pets", "trigger": "Group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Frog,Duck", "name": "Pets"}}, {"span": "send Pets to the back", "trigger": "send", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Pets"}}, {"span": "Is Lily in any group", "trigger": "in any group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Lily"}}]}
{"id": "g7-037", "domain": "wedding venue", "names": ["Cake", "Band", "Dj", "Floor", "Bar", "Photo"], "groups": {"Music": ["Band", "Dj"]}, "text": "Wedding venue. Floor: convert it into a large white ellipse for the dance. Bar becomes a square. Put Photo and Cake together under the name Sweet, and add Bar to Music for fun. Align Music horizontally, distribute Music horizontally. Which group is Photo in? What groups exist, in total?", "wires": [{"span": "convert it into a large white ellipse", "trigger": "convert", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Floor", "shape": "ellipse", "color": "white", "size": "large"}}, {"span": "Bar becomes a square", "trigger": "becomes", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bar", "shape": "square"}}, {"span": "Put Photo and Cake together under the name Sweet", "trigger": "together", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Photo,Cake", "name": "Sweet"}}, {"span": "add Bar to Music", "trigger": "add", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Bar,Music", "name": "Music"}}, {"span": "Align Music horizontally", "trigger": "Align", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Music", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "distribute Music horizontally", "trigger": "distribute", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Music", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "Which group is Photo in", "trigger": "Which group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Photo"}}, {"span": "What groups exist", "trigger": "What groups", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "kind": "group"}}]}
